-only and flow matchers. They"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are intended to catch ambiguous authoring early without changing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matcher’s runtime semantics."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For release-readiness gates, use the throwing strict initializers:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"DeepLinkMatcher(strict:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for push-only mappings and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"FlowDeepLinkMatcher(strict:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for mappings that expand into a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"FlowPlan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Strict initializers throw ","type":"text"},{"code":"DeepLinkMatcherStrictError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the full diagnostic list instead of only logging warnings, and accept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same ","type":"text"},{"code":"DeepLinkInputLimits","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" guardrails used by non-strict matchers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Input limits","anchor":"Input-limits"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"DeepLinkInputLimits","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" guards runtime URLs before matching. Configure it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on ","type":"text"},{"code":"DeepLinkMatcherConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"DeepLinkPipeline","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"FlowDeepLinkPipeline","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to cap absolute URL length, path segment count,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and query item count. Direct matcher calls still return ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their public contract is optional. Pipeline and effect-handler paths","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"surface limit violations as typed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"DeepLinkRejectionReason.inputLimitExceeded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rejections instead of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“no match” outcomes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting"],["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink\/documentation\/InnoRouterDeepLink\/InnoRouterDeepLink"]]},"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/innorouterdeeplink\/matcher-and-diagnostics"]}],"references":{"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink/documentation/InnoRouterDeepLink/InnoRouterDeepLink":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink\/documentation\/InnoRouterDeepLink\/InnoRouterDeepLink","role":"collectionGroup","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Pattern matching, pipeline planning, and pending deep-link handling for InnoRouter.","type":"text"}],"title":"InnoRouterDeepLink","url":"\/documentation\/innorouterdeeplink\/innorouterdeeplink"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink/documentation/InnoRouterTesting":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting","kind":"symbol","title":"InnoRouterTesting","abstract":[]}}}